---@class posthog.signals.ReportRanking
---@field status posthog.signals.RankingStatusEnum scored: the predictions describe the current text. stale: the title or summary changed after the text the model read, so the predictions describe the old text and the model sorts and filters treat the report as unscored. unscored: the model has not scored the report yet, or skipped it. This does not mean a low score. not_available: you cannot see the ranking model's output, so every other field is empty. * `scored` - scored * `stale` - stale * `unscored` - unscored * `not_available` - not_available
---@field model string|distilled.Null Key of the served model that wrote the score, as `<model_name>@<model_version>`. Do not compare predictions from different keys.
---@field scored_at string|distilled.Null When the scoring sweep scored the report.
---@field predictions posthog.signals.ReportRankingPredictionsList The served model's predictions, one per public outcome that it scored. A prediction says what may happen, never what did: the report's status and its PR fields say whether it was resolved.

---@class posthog.signals.ReportRankingPrediction
---@field outcome posthog.signals.RankingOutcomeEnum Outcome the model predicts. Read inbox-ranking-outcomes-list for what each outcome means. * `open` - Open * `action` - Action * `fix` - Fix
---@field probability number The model's calibrated probability that the outcome happens within the outcome's horizon.
---@field lift number|distilled.Null The probability divided by the outcome's base rate. 1.0 is an average report, 2.7 means 2.7x as likely as the average report. Compare lifts across outcomes, not raw probabilities. Null when the model has no saved base rate for the outcome.
---@field readable boolean True when the training run could read the outcome's holdout AUC. Treat other outcomes with caution.

---The served model's predictions, one per public outcome that it scored. A prediction says what may happen, never what did: the report's status and its PR fields say whether it was resolved.
