---One check as a scout run reads it back.
---@class posthog.signals.ScoutCheckSummary
---@field check_id string The check.
---@field report_id string The report it is attached to.
---@field title string The expectation the check states.
---@field kind string `metric_threshold` (the coordinator measures it) or `agent` (a run does).
---@field status string `pending` while the check waits for the report to resolve, `active` while it still runs; every other value is terminal.
---@field next_run_at string When the check next runs. Provisional while it is `pending`.
---@field last_outcome string|distilled.Null Verdict of the most recent run; null before the first.
---@field last_outcome_reason string|distilled.Null Why the most recent run was `inconclusive`: `awaiting_data`, `unmeasurable`, `needs_manual_verification`, or `no_fix_to_measure`. Null on any other outcome.
---@field run_state string Where the check is in its run cycle. `waiting_on_report`: pending, no fix to measure yet. `paused`: active, but its report is suppressed or its horizon passed, so nothing runs it. `scheduled`: active, not due yet. `due`: due now, so a run on the check's scout may record the verdict. `queued`: a run was dispatched and has not started. `running`: the dispatched run started and has time left. `stale`: the dispatched run recorded nothing in its window, so the coordinator dispatches again. Any other value is the terminal status.
---@field waiting_on_run boolean True while an `agent` check waits on a dispatched run to record its verdict.
---@field dispatched_run_id string|distilled.Null The scout run the coordinator dispatched for the check, once it started. Null while queued.
---@field dispatched_at string|distilled.Null When the coordinator last dispatched a run for the check. Null when no run waits.

