---@field created_by_run_id string|distilled.Null Scout run that wrote this entry, or null when a report-pipeline stage or a human wrote it.
---@field created_by_skill? string|distilled.Null Who created this entry: the canonical skill name of the scout that wrote it (e.g. `signals-scout-apm`), or the report-pipeline stage that did (`pipeline:report-research`, `pipeline:implementation`). Null if human-authored.
