---@class posthog.signals.SearchSignalsActivitySummaryMemberRequest
---@field project_id string Project ID of the project you're trying to access. To find the ID of the project, make a call to /api/projects/.
---@field exclude_user_uuids? posthog.signals.SearchSignalsActivitySummaryMemberRequestExcludeUserUuidsList Members to leave out, such as people you already checked.
---@field include_profile? boolean Add the one-page markdown profile to each result. Set it only for the people you want to read.
---@field limit? number The most results to return, best match first.
---@field product? posthog.signals.SearchSignalsActivitySummaryMemberRequestProduct|string Only members who work in or visit this product. * `product_analytics` - Product Analytics * `dashboards` - Dashboards * `web_analytics` - Web Analytics * `session_replay` - Session Replay * `heatmaps` - Heatmaps * `error_tracking` - Error Tracking * `experiments` - Experiments * `feature_flags` - Feature Flags * `early_access_features` - Early Access Features * `surveys` - Surveys * `product_tours` - Product Tours * `notebooks` - Notebooks * `cohorts` - Cohorts * `persons` - Persons * `data_management` - Data Management * `data_warehouse` - Data Warehouse * `data_pipelines` - Data Pipelines * `workflows` - Workflows * `ai_observability` - Ai Observability * `mcp_analytics` - Mcp Analytics * `logs` - Logs * `tracing` - Tracing * `endpoints` - Endpoints * `revenue_analytics` - Revenue Analytics * `customer_analytics` - Customer Analytics * `inbox` - Inbox * `canvases` - Canvases * `support` - Support
---@field query? string Natural language or keywords, such as an object name, a topic or a product area. Without a query, the search lists members with a summary, the newest summary first.
---@field search_mode? posthog.signals.SearchSignalsActivitySummaryMemberRequestSearchMode|string `hybrid` merges the keyword and semantic rankings. `semantic` ranks by meaning only, and returns 503 when the vector search fails. `keyword` matches query terms in the profile, the headline, the theme labels and the names of owned and watched objects. * `hybrid` - Hybrid * `semantic` - Semantic * `keyword` - Keyword

