---@class posthog.signals.SignalsReportChecksReplaceCreateRequest
---@field project_id string Project ID of the project you're trying to access. To find the ID of the project, make a call to /api/projects/.
---@field report_id string
---@field id string A UUID string identifying this Signal report check.
---@field title string Label for the new metric check.
---@field rationale? string Why this check is better.
---@field config posthog.signals.MetricThresholdReplacementConfig Metric threshold configuration, including a bounded query, comparison, and required Monitoring definition.
---@field soak_minutes? number Observation window in minutes from Monitoring start. Omission preserves the existing window, including zero. Replacing a check during Monitoring restarts the period for all open checks.
---@field run_interval_minutes? number Minutes between interim Monitoring measurements. Must be at least six hours and shorter than the observation window. Omit to use a quarter of the window, bounded to six hours through one day. Windows of six hours or less have no interim samples.
---@field runs_remaining? number Monitoring performs one terminal evaluation. Omit or set to 1; higher counts are not supported. Interim measurements do not consume this count.

